# Mountain King a against Mountain King b; syntax and checks: smashcraft:docs/native-bot-session.md.
#! chat -dev quick hero mountain king
# b dashes in; a dashes in and attacks short of it, then runs back left and turns to face b.
40 b stick -1 0
42 b stick 0 0
50 a stick 1 0
52 a stick 0 0
70 a tap A 2
130 a stick -1 0
160 a stick 0 0
170 a stick 1 0
171 a stick 0 0
# b casts the small Clap (special on the charge's 16th frame), the full Thunder Clap (36th),
# three charges dropped by shield, then Thunder Leap.
180 b stick 0 -1
180 b tap X 2
181 b stick 0 0
195 b tap X 2
225 b stick 0 -1
225 b tap X 2
226 b stick 0 0
260 b tap X 2
300 b stick 0 -1
300 b tap X 2
# a: Thunder Clap in the air.
300 a tap B 8
301 b stick 0 0
306 a stick 0 -1
306 a tap X 2
307 a stick 0 0
308 a capture
312 b shield 1
316 b shield 0
324 a capture
332 b stick 0 -1
332 b tap X 2
333 b stick 0 0
344 b shield 1
348 b shield 0
364 b stick 0 -1
364 b tap X 2
365 b stick 0 0
376 b shield 1
# a: Storm Rush on the ground.
380 a stick 1 0
380 a tap X 2
380 b shield 0
381 a stick 0 0
382 a capture
393 a capture
400 b stick 0 1
400 b tap X 2
401 b stick 0 0
# a turns away and throws Storm Bolt, then calls it back while it flies.
440 a stick -1 0
441 a stick 0 0
450 a tap X 2
452 a capture
470 a capture
# View held a second: the first of two moments the parity check replays.
500 a press VIEW
510 a tap X 2
512 a capture
514 a capture
560 a stick 1 0
561 a stick 0 0
570 a release VIEW
600 a tap X 2
634 a capture
660 a tap X 2
695 a capture
720 a tap X 2
757 a capture
# Storm Rush in the air.
790 a tap B 8
796 a stick 1 0
796 a tap X 2
797 a stick 0 0
798 a capture
809 a capture
# Thunder Leap and Hammerfall on its 16th frame.
880 a stick 0 1
880 a tap X 2
881 a stick 0 0
882 a capture
889 a capture
895 a tap X 2
# Expected, frame by frame (headless run of this script): every form of every special starts,
# b's charge drops on the shield (form 18); Thunder Leap uses its ground form.
#! expect b 180 special 16 form 0
#! expect b 195 special-form 6 action 16
#! expect b 225 special 16 form 0
#! expect b 260 special-form 12 action 16
#! expect b 312 special 0 form 18
#! expect b 400 special 15 form 0
#! expect a 306 special 16 form 1
#! expect a 380 special 14 form 0
#! expect a 450 special 13 form 0
#! expect a 510 special 13 form 3
#! expect a 796 special 14 form 1
#! expect a 880 special 15 form 0
#! expect a 895 special-form 6 action 15
# Startup and active cues of each special and branch and both missiles.
#! scene a ForkedLightningTarget
#! scene a LightningShieldBuff
#! scene a DefendCaster
#! scene a ImpaleTargetDust
#! scene a WarStompCaster
#! scene a LightningShieldTarget
#! scene a ThunderClapCaster
#! scene a EarthquakeTarget
#! scene a StormBoltMissile
#! scene a ShockwaveMissile
897 a capture
1000 a press VIEW
1070 a release VIEW
